 href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></div></div></li></ul><details class=\"kn-m\"><summary>MENU</summary><nav><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Topics</a><a href=\"{{p:atoz}}\">A–Z index</a><a href=\"{{p:guide}}\">Guide: Remove a red wine stain</a><a href=\"{{p:checklists}}\">Checklists</a><a href=\"{{p:about}}\">About</a><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></nav></details></header>","foot":"<footer class=\"kn-foot\"><div class=\"top\"><div><div class=\"big\">knack index</div><p style=\"margin-top:8px;font:500 15px/1.8 var(--f-body);opacity:.85;max-width:34ch\">Short, tested answers to everyday questions about home, money and health. Template demo content.</p></div><div class=\"cols\"><div><h4>Find</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Topics</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:atoz}}\">A–Z index</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Read</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:guide}}\">Guide: Remove a red wine stain</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:checklists}}\">Checklists</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Info</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:about}}\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Utility</h4><ul><li><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"copy\">© 2026 Knack Index</div></footer>","pages":{"home":"<section class=\"kn-hero\"><h1>Quick answers to <em>everyday</em> things.</h1><p>Short, tested how-tos for home, money, health and tech. Type what you're stuck on.</p><div class=\"kn-search\"><span>?</span><input id=\"kn-q\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"e.g. wine stain, subscriptions, sleep\" aria-label=\"Search answers\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"kn-chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Category\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-c=\"all\">All</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-c=\"home\" style=\"--k:#ff7f6e\"><i></i>Home</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-c=\"money\" style=\"--k:#f2c14e\"><i></i>Money</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-c=\"health\" style=\"--k:#8fc9a9\"><i></i>Health</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-c=\"tech\" style=\"--k:#8fb4e8\"><i></i>Tech</button></div></section>\n<section class=\"kn-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"kn-res\" id=\"kn-res\"><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"home\" style=\"--k:#ff7f6e\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Home</span><h3>Remove a red wine stain</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Blot, don't rub. Cover with salt for 10 minutes, then rinse with cold water and wash as normal. <a href=\"{{p:guide}}\">Full guide →</a></div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"home\" style=\"--k:#ff7f6e\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Home</span><h3>Unclog a slow drain</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Pour a kettle of hot water, then ½ cup baking soda and ½ cup vinegar. Wait 15 minutes and flush again.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"home\" style=\"--k:#ff7f6e\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Home</span><h3>Keep herbs fresh for two weeks</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Trim stems, stand them in a jar of water, cover loosely with a bag and refrigerate. Basil stays on the counter.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"home\" style=\"--k:#ff7f6e\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Home</span><h3>Know when to change smoke-alarm batteries</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Every 12 months; the unit itself every 10 years. Check the date on the back.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"home\" style=\"--k:#ff7f6e\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Home</span><h3>Defrost chicken safely</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Overnight in the fridge, or sealed in cold water for 1 hour per kg. Never on the counter.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"money\" style=\"--k:#f2c14e\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Money</span><h3>Build a first emergency fund</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Start with one month of essentials. Automate a transfer on payday, even a small one.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"money\" style=\"--k:#f2c14e\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Money</span><h3>Check a subscription you forgot</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Search your bank statement for monthly charges. Cancel anything unused for 60 days.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"money\" style=\"--k:#f2c14e\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Money</span><h3>Compare unit prices</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Look for the small price per 100 g or per litre on the shelf label, not the sticker price.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"money\" style=\"--k:#f2c14e\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Money</span><h3>Negotiate a bill</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Call, mention a competitor's offer, and ask what the best price is. Be polite and ask twice.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"health\" style=\"--k:#8fc9a9\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Health</span><h3>Sleep better tonight</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Dim lights an hour before bed, keep the room cool and put your phone across the room.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"health\" style=\"--k:#8fc9a9\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Health</span><h3>Do a 2-minute desk reset</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Stand, roll your shoulders, look at something far away for 20 seconds, then drink water.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"health\" style=\"--k:#8fc9a9\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Health</span><h3>Know when to call a doctor for a fever</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Adults: above 39.4°C or lasting more than 3 days. Babies under 3 months: any fever, same day.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"tech\" style=\"--k:#8fb4e8\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Tech</span><h3>Make a strong password you can remember</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Use four random words, 16+ characters. Store them in a password manager.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"tech\" style=\"--k:#8fb4e8\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Tech</span><h3>Free up phone storage fast</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Delete downloaded podcasts, clear message attachments and offload unused apps.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"tech\" style=\"--k:#8fb4e8\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Tech</span><h3>Spot a phishing email</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Check the sender's real address, hover on links, and be wary of urgency. When unsure, go to the site directly.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"tech\" style=\"--k:#8fb4e8\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Tech</span><h3>Back up your photos</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Keep three copies, on two kinds of storage, one off-site. Cloud plus a drive is enough.</div></details></div><p class=\"kn-none\" id=\"kn-none\">No answer yet. Try a shorter word, like \"stain\" or \"bill\".</p></section>\n<section class=\"kn-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"kn-tip\"><div class=\"n\" id=\"kn-tn\">01</div><div><span style=\"font:700 12px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--c-accent)\">Tip of the day</span><h3 id=\"kn-tt\">Remove a red wine stain</h3><p id=\"kn-ta\"></p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"kn-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"kn-h\"><h2>Browse by topic</h2><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">All topics →</a></div><div class=\"kn-tops\"><a class=\"kn-top\" href=\"{{p:topics}}\" style=\"--k:#ff7f6e\"><i></i><b>Home</b><span>Cleaning, repairs, food storage</span></a><a class=\"kn-top\" href=\"{{p:topics}}\" style=\"--k:#f2c14e\"><i></i><b>Money</b><span>Saving, bills, shopping smart</span></a><a class=\"kn-top\" href=\"{{p:topics}}\" style=\"--k:#8fc9a9\"><i></i><b>Health</b><span>Sleep, habits, first aid basics</span></a><a class=\"kn-top\" href=\"{{p:topics}}\" style=\"--k:#8fb4e8\"><i></i><b>Tech</b><span>Passwords, backups, scams</span></a></div></section><script>(function(){var q=document.getElementById('kn-q'),cards=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.kn-card')),chips=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.kn-chips button')),none=document.getElementById('kn-none'),cat='all';if(!cards.length)return;function u(){var s=(q&&q.value||'').toLowerCase().trim(),n=0;cards.forEach(function(c){var t=c.textContent.toLowerCase(),ok=(cat==='all'||c.dataset.c===cat)&&(!s||t.indexOf(s)>=0);c.classList.toggle('hide',!ok);if(ok)n++});if(none)none.style.display=n?'none':'block'}if(q)q.addEventListener('input',u);chips.forEach(function(b){b.onclick=function(){cat=b.dataset.c;chips.forEach(function(x){x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',x===b)});u()}});u()})();</script><script>(function(){var T=[[\"Remove a red wine stain\", \"Blot, don't rub. Cover with salt for 10 minutes, then rinse with cold water and wash as normal.\"], [\"Unclog a slow drain\", \"Pour a kettle of hot water, then ½ cup baking soda and ½ cup vinegar. Wait 15 minutes and flush again.\"], [\"Keep herbs fresh for two weeks\", \"Trim stems, stand them in a jar of water, cover loosely with a bag and refrigerate. Basil stays on the counter.\"], [\"Know when to change smoke-alarm batteries\", \"Every 12 months; the unit itself every 10 years. Check the date on the back.\"], [\"Defrost chicken safely\", \"Overnight in the fridge, or sealed in cold water for 1 hour per kg. Never on the counter.\"], [\"Build a first emergency fund\", \"Start with one month of essentials. Automate a transfer on payday, even a small one.\"], [\"Check a subscription you forgot\", \"Search your bank statement for monthly charges. Cancel anything unused for 60 days.\"], [\"Compare unit prices\", \"Look for the small price per 100 g or per litre on the shelf label, not the sticker price.\"], [\"Negotiate a bill\", \"Call, mention a competitor's offer, and ask what the best price is. Be polite and ask twice.\"], [\"Sleep better tonight\", \"Dim lights an hour before bed, keep the room cool and put your phone across the room.\"], [\"Do a 2-minute desk reset\", \"Stand, roll your shoulders, look at something far away for 20 seconds, then drink water.\"], [\"Know when to call a doctor for a fever\", \"Adults: above 39.4°C or lasting more than 3 days. Babies under 3 months: any fever, same day.\"], [\"Make a strong password you can remember\", \"Use four random words, 16+ characters. Store them in a password manager.\"], [\"Free up phone storage fast\", \"Delete downloaded podcasts, clear message attachments and offload unused apps.\"], [\"Spot a phishing email\", \"Check the sender's real address, hover on links, and be wary of urgency. When unsure, go to the site directly.\"], [\"Back up your photos\", \"Keep three copies, on two kinds of storage, one off-site. Cloud plus a drive is enough.\"]];var d=Math.floor(Date.now()/864e5)%T.length,n=document.getElementById('kn-tn');if(!n)return;n.textContent=String(d+1).padStart(2,'0');document.getElementById('kn-tt').textContent=T[d][0];document.getElementById('kn-ta').textContent=T[d][1]})();</script>","topics":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Topics</b></div><h1 style=\"font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em\">Topics</h1><p class=\"lead\">Four areas, sixteen answers and counting.</p></div></section><section class=\"kn-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"kn-chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Category\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-c=\"all\">All</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-c=\"home\" style=\"--k:#ff7f6e\"><i></i>Home</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-c=\"money\" style=\"--k:#f2c14e\"><i></i>Money</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-c=\"health\" style=\"--k:#8fc9a9\"><i></i>Health</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-c=\"tech\" style=\"--k:#8fb4e8\"><i></i>Tech</b