 anything unused for 60 days.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"money\" style=\"--k:#f2c14e\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Money</span><h3>Compare unit prices</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Look for the small price per 100 g or per litre on the shelf label, not the sticker price.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"money\" style=\"--k:#f2c14e\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Money</span><h3>Negotiate a bill</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Call, mention a competitor's offer, and ask what the best price is. Be polite and ask twice.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"health\" style=\"--k:#8fc9a9\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Health</span><h3>Sleep better tonight</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Dim lights an hour before bed, keep the room cool and put your phone across the room.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"health\" style=\"--k:#8fc9a9\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Health</span><h3>Do a 2-minute desk reset</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Stand, roll your shoulders, look at something far away for 20 seconds, then drink water.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"health\" style=\"--k:#8fc9a9\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Health</span><h3>Know when to call a doctor for a fever</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Adults: above 39.4°C or lasting more than 3 days. Babies under 3 months: any fever, same day.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"tech\" style=\"--k:#8fb4e8\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Tech</span><h3>Make a strong password you can remember</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Use four random words, 16+ characters. Store them in a password manager.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"tech\" style=\"--k:#8fb4e8\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Tech</span><h3>Free up phone storage fast</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Delete downloaded podcasts, clear message attachments and offload unused apps.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"tech\" style=\"--k:#8fb4e8\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Tech</span><h3>Spot a phishing email</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Check the sender's real address, hover on links, and be wary of urgency. When unsure, go to the site directly.</div></details><details class=\"kn-card\" data-c=\"tech\" style=\"--k:#8fb4e8\"><summary><span class=\"k\">Tech</span><h3>Back up your photos</h3></summary><div class=\"a\">Keep three copies, on two kinds of storage, one off-site. Cloud plus a drive is enough.</div></details></div><p class=\"kn-none\" id=\"kn-none\">No answer yet. Try a shorter word, like \"stain\" or \"bill\".</p></section><script>(function(){var q=document.getElementById('kn-q'),cards=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.kn-card')),chips=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.kn-chips button')),none=document.getElementById('kn-none'),cat='all';if(!cards.length)return;function u(){var s=(q&&q.value||'').toLowerCase().trim(),n=0;cards.forEach(function(c){var t=c.textContent.toLowerCase(),ok=(cat==='all'||c.dataset.c===cat)&&(!s||t.indexOf(s)>=0);c.classList.toggle('hide',!ok);if(ok)n++});if(none)none.style.display=n?'none':'block'}if(q)q.addEventListener('input',u);chips.forEach(function(b){b.onclick=function(){cat=b.dataset.c;chips.forEach(function(x){x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',x===b)});u()}});u()})();</script>","atoz":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>A–Z index</b></div><h1 style=\"font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em\">A–Z index</h1><p class=\"lead\">Every answer, alphabetically.</p></div></section><section class=\"kn-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"kn-az\"><a href=\"#az-B\">B</a><a href=\"#az-C\">C</a><a href=\"#az-D\">D</a><a href=\"#az-F\">F</a><a href=\"#az-K\">K</a><a href=\"#az-M\">M</a><a href=\"#az-N\">N</a><a href=\"#az-R\">R</a><a href=\"#az-S\">S</a><a href=\"#az-U\">U</a></div><div class=\"kn-idx\"><h3 id=\"az-B\">B</h3><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Back up your photos<span>Tech</span></a><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Build a first emergency fund<span>Money</span></a><h3 id=\"az-C\">C</h3><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Check a subscription you forgot<span>Money</span></a><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Compare unit prices<span>Money</span></a><h3 id=\"az-D\">D</h3><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Defrost chicken safely<span>Home</span></a><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Do a 2-minute desk reset<span>Health</span></a><h3 id=\"az-F\">F</h3><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Free up phone storage fast<span>Tech</span></a><h3 id=\"az-K\">K</h3><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Keep herbs fresh for two weeks<span>Home</span></a><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Know when to call a doctor for a fever<span>Health</span></a><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Know when to change smoke-alarm batteries<span>Home</span></a><h3 id=\"az-M\">M</h3><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Make a strong password you can remember<span>Tech</span></a><h3 id=\"az-N\">N</h3><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Negotiate a bill<span>Money</span></a><h3 id=\"az-R\">R</h3><a href=\"{{p:guide}}\">Remove a red wine stain<span>Home</span></a><h3 id=\"az-S\">S</h3><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Sleep better tonight<span>Health</span></a><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Spot a phishing email<span>Tech</span></a><h3 id=\"az-U\">U</h3><a href=\"{{p:topics}}\">Unclog a slow drain<span>Home</span></a></div></section>","guide":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Guide</b></div><h1 style=\"font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em\">How to remove a red wine stain</h1><p class=\"lead\">Works on cotton, linen and most synthetics. Faster is better.</p></div></section><section class=\"kn-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"kn-how\"><ol class=\"kn-steps\"><li><span><b>Blot</b> the stain with a dry cloth. Press, don't rub — rubbing spreads it.</span></li><li><span>Cover it with a thick layer of <b>salt</b>. Leave 10 minutes while it pulls the wine up.</span></li><li><span>Rinse from the back with <b>cold</b> water. Warm water sets the stain.</span></li><li><span>Rub in a little dish soap and white vinegar, rest 5 minutes, rinse again.</span></li><li><span>Wash as normal. Check it's gone before the dryer.</span></li></ol>\n<div style=\"display:grid;gap:14px\"><div class=\"kn-box\"><h3>You'll need</h3><ul><li>Dry cloth or paper towel</li><li>Table salt</li><li>Dish soap and white vinegar</li></ul></div><div class=\"kn-box kn-warn\"><h3>Don't</h3><ul><li>Use hot water first</li><li>Use bleach on wool or silk</li><li>Dry it until the stain is gone</li></ul></div></div></div></section>","checklists":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Checklists</b></div><h1 style=\"font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em\">Checklists</h1><p class=\"lead\">Tick as you go. Progress stays in this browser.</p></div></section><section class=\"kn-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><h2 style=\"font:700 24px var(--f-head);margin-bottom:6px\">Moving-out checklist</h2><p id=\"kn-cnt\" style=\"font:700 14px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary);margin-bottom:10px\"></p><div class=\"kn-bar\" id=\"kn-bar\"><i></i></div><div class=\"kn-ck\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span>Give notice to landlord (30 days)</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span>Book movers or van</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span>Transfer electricity, water and internet</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span>Update your address with bank and employer</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span>Photograph the empty rooms</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span>Return keys and get the deposit receipt</span></label></div></section><script>(function(){var c=document.querySelectorAll('.kn-ck input'),b=document.getElementById('kn-bar'),K='kn-ck';if(!c.length)return;var s=[];try{s=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(K)||'[]')}catch(e){}c.forEach(function(i,k){i.checked=s.indexOf(k)>=0;i.onchange=u});function u(){var a=[];c.forEach(function(i,k){if(i.checked)a.push(k)});try{localStorage.setItem(K,JSON.stringify(a))}catch(e){}b.style.setProperty('--p',Math.round(a.length/c.length*100)+'%');document.getElementById('kn-cnt').textContent=a.length+' of '+c.length+' done'}u()})();</script>","about":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>About</b></div><h1 style=\"font-weight:700\">About</h1></div></section><section class=\"kn-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div style=\"max-width:60ch;font:500 19px/1.8 var(--f-body)\"><p>Knack Index is a small team that tests every tip before we publish it. If a tip fails, we say so. Replace this with your own story and editorial standards.</p></div></section>","faq":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>FAQ</b></div><h1 style=\"font-weight:700\">FAQ</h1></div></section><section class=\"kn-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>Is this professional advice?</summary><p>No. For health, legal or financial decisions, please speak to a qualified professional.</p></details><details><summary>How do you test tips?</summary><p>Each tip is tried twice by us and checked against at least one reliable source.</p></details><details><summary>Can I suggest a topic?</summary><p>Yes. Use the contact page; we answer every message.</p></details></div></section>","privacy":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Privacy policy</b></div><h1 style=\"\">Privacy policy</h1></div></section><section class=\"kn-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"prose\"><p>Replace with your privacy policy: what you collect, why, how long you keep it and how customers can ask for deletion.</p></div></section>","404":"<section class=\"kn-sec\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-top:clamp(50px,9v